  "previousAbc": "\nT:Jesus Our Shepherd\nC:Tune: HERMON - Lowell Mason\nR:Psalm 23, C. M.\nM:3/2\nL:1/8\nK:Ab\n%%score (T1 T2)(B1 B2)\nV:T1 clef=treble\nV:T2 clef=treble\nV:B1 clef=bass\nV:B2 clef=bass\nV:T1\nE4 | C2 D2 E2 A2 F2 A2 | E6 || A2 A2 A2 | (G3 A B4) G4 | A8 || c4 | c2 c2 c4 c4 | c2 B2 B2 || G2 A2 E2 | F4 F4 HE4 |]\nw:1.~My faith-ful Shep-herd is the Lord, Sup-ply-ing all _ _ my needs; In pas-tures green He makes me rest, By qui-et wa-ters leads.\nw:2.~He ten-der-ly re-stores my soul When I am in _ _ dis-tress, And for His Name's sake guides my feet In paths of right-eous-ness.\nw:3.~Thro' death's dark val-ley though I walk, No e-vil will _ _ I fear; Thy rod and staff will com-fort me, For Thou art ev-er near.\nw:4.~A ta-ble Thou dost spread for me In pres-ence of _ _ my foes; Thou hast a-noint-ed me with oil, My cup of joy o'er-flows.\nw:5.~Thro' life Thy good-ness and Thy grace Shall dai-ly fol- _ _ low me; And I, with-in Thy house, O Lord, Shall ev-er dwell with Thee.\nV:T2\nC4 | A,2 B,2 C2 C2 D2 F2 | C6 || E2 E2 E2 | E8 E4 | E8 || E4 | E2 E2 F4 F4 | F2 F2 E2 || E2 E2 C2 | D4 D4 C4 |]\nV:B1\nA,4 | A,2 A,2 A,2 A,2 A,2 A,2 | A,6 || C2 E2 C2 | (B,3 C D4) B,4 | C8 || A,4 | A,2 A,2 A,4 A,4 | A,2 A,2 G,2 || B,2 A,2 A,2 | A,4 A,4 HA,4 |]\nV:B2\nA,,4 | A,,2 A,,2 A,,2 A,,2 A,,2 A,,2 | A,,6 || A,,2 C,2 A,,2 | E,8 E,4 | A,,8 || A,4 | A,2 A,2 F,4 F,4 | =D,2 D,2 E,2 || _D,2 C,2 A,,2 | D,4 D,4 A,,4 |]\n"
